{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-411","title":{"zh":"冷静应对","en":"A Show of Level-Headedness"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","start":"first_contact.411","chapters":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"过了一会儿，[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的热烈气氛逐渐平静下来。我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]渐渐能够理解这些信号，最终能够确定他们是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，并对他们古怪的行为作出解释。\n\n事实证明，[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]是一个好战的物种，他们最看重他们所说的“战士精神”。正确的应对方式是做出类似的回应。然而，他们似乎足够宽宏大量，以至于接受了我们对此的无","en":"After a while, the enthusiasm of displays by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] vessel declined. Over time, our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] grew better at understanding their signals, eventually identifying them as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and presen"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.411","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.411","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷静应对","en":"A Show of Level-Headedness"},"texts":[{"zh":"过了一会儿，[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的热烈气氛逐渐平静下来。我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]渐渐能够理解这些信号，最终能够确定他们是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，并对他们古怪的行为作出解释。\n\n事实证明，[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]是一个好战的物种，他们最看重他们所说的“战士精神”。正确的应对方式是做出类似的回应。然而，他们似乎足够宽宏大量，以至于接受了我们对此的无知，甚至开始认可我们面对威胁时的冷静。","en":"After a while, the enthusiasm of displays by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] vessel declined. Over time, our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] grew better at understanding their signals, eventually identifying them as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and presenting an interpretation of their odd behavior.\n\nIt turns out that the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural] are a warlike species who value above all else what they call the \"warrior spirit\". The correct response would have been to make a similar gesture back. However, it seems they are magnanimous enough to accept that we could not have known this, and have even come to value our level-headedness in the face of what seemed like a threat."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.411.A","label":{"zh":"很好，把他们的影像接过来！","en":"Very good. Bring them on screen!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12860","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12860","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:437","story":"event-cara-1020"},{"target":"cara.2020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12860","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","s